OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure and evacuation amid
OL,4,A'unsafe' building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA key route in a historic market town
OL,7,Fhas been closed after a building
OL,8,Fpartially collapsed.
OL,10,FWiltshire Police said it had closed
OL,11,FNorth Street in Wilton near Salisbury
OL,12,Fafter a report on Friday morning that a
OL,13,Fbuilding was "unsafe".
OL,15,FThe side wall of the property, formerly
OL,16,Fthe Six Bells pub, has given way and
OL,17,Fpolice cordons remain in place at the
OL,18,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
